.SH NAME
inspekt\-screenshot \- Capture a screenshot of the browser viewport,
full page, or element.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]screenshot\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Capture a screenshot of the browser viewport, full page, or element.
.PP
Screenshot targets:
.IP \(bu 2
viewport: Visible browser area (default, fastest)
.IP \(bu 2
page: Full scrollable page (stitched screenshots)
.IP \(bu 2
element: Specific element by CSS selector
.PP
Output formats:
.IP \(bu 2
png: Lossless, larger files (default)
.IP \(bu 2
jpeg: Lossy compression, smaller files
.PP
Returns base64\-encoded image data that can be:
.IP \(bu 2
Saved to file
.IP \(bu 2
Embedded in HTML/markdown
.IP \(bu 2
Analyzed by vision models
